# Allowlist: upload only what the web and API services build from (never .env, data/ or docs/).
/*
!vercel.json
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps
!packages
!services
!infra
# ...and nothing local inside the allowed folders: secrets, keys, databases, build output
**/.env*
*.pem
*.key
*.db
*.sqlite
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/.next
**/__pycache__
